    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer CHARACTER_ORIENTATION = 4;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant CHARACTER_ORIENTATION has the value 4</p>
  <p>Constant used to indicate that the following argument is the orientation of the capsule for a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Pathfinding" target="_blank">Pathfinding</a> character. This is used to help denote how to interpret the size of a character.</p>
</p>
